VideoResolution: every form its examples take (area 19, "Changing a standard type's encoding")
encoding 1
column width integer
column height integer

example 1280x720
text 1280x720
json {"width":1280,"height":720}
stored width 1280
stored height 720

example 1920x1080
text 1920x1080
json {"width":1920,"height":1080}
stored width 1920
stored height 1080

example 3840x2160
text 3840x2160
json {"width":3840,"height":2160}
stored width 3840
stored height 2160

example 4096x2160
text 4096x2160
json {"width":4096,"height":2160}
stored width 4096
stored height 2160
